ns, and resource management strategies at national and institutional levels.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG04_TVET_012', 'TVET', 'Programme evaluation and adaptation', 'Use strategies to challenge gender stereotypes and create inclusive, safe, and supportive learning environments.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG04_TVET_013', 'TVET', 'Programme evaluation and adaptation', 'Analyse trends in STEM and relate them to future education needs, employability, and labour market shifts.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG04_TVET_014', 'TVET', 'Programme evaluation and adaptation', 'Integrate Indigenous knowledge and non-formal learning traditions into curriculum and training design.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG04_TVET_015', 'TVET', 'Programme evaluation and adaptation', 'Assess child growth and development within different social, cultural, and environmental contexts for ECCE programming.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG04_TVET_016', 'TVET', 'Programme evaluation and adaptation', 'Plan and support ECCE initiatives that strengthen early learning foundations, equity, and lifelong learning pathways.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG04_TER_001', 'Tertiary education', 'Critical engagement and reimagining education', 'Reconceive education to reflect inclusivity, creativity and diversity of thought and identity.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG04_TER_002', 'Tertiary education', 'Critical engagement and reimagining education', 'Analyse local and national learning contexts and propose education strategies tailored to real-world needs.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG04_TER_003', 'Tertiary education', 'Policy and advocacy', 'Interpret global education goals (including SDG4) and national policies to identify gaps and advocate for reforms.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG04_TER_004', 'Tertiary education', 'Policy and advocacy', 'Contribute to evidence-based policy proposals and engage in advocacy for educational justice.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG04_TER_005', 'Tertiary education', 'Curriculum design and assessment', 'Design and implement competency-based curricula aligned with